{
  "summary": "The current codebase still has several high‑ and medium‑severity issues from the previous review. All dependency vulnerabilities that are fixable (uuid) have been addressed, and the CSV‑injection and PDF‑HTML‑injection findings have been mitigated in code. However, high‑severity transitive dependencies (braces, node‑forge) remain vulnerable, and many medium‑severity code‑level concerns (numeric validation, backup passphrase policy, web key storage, temporary backup file cleanup, image size limits, key persistence after data‑wipe) are still open. No new critical issues were discovered, but the remaining high‑severity findings block release until resolved.",
  "previous": [
    {
      "id": "high-deps-braces-2026-93687",
      "status": "open",
      "severity": "high",
      "severity_change_reason": "no change – braces remains vulnerable with no patched version available"
    },
    {
      "id": "high-deps-node-forge-2026-85393",
      "status": "open",
      "severity": "high",
      "severity_change_reason": "no change – node‑forge remains vulnerable with no patched version available"
    },
    {
      "id": "high-csv-injection",
      "status": "fixed",
      "severity": "high",
      "severity_change_reason": "code now sanitises CSV fields (prefixes a single quote or fully quotes values) – verified by __tests__/exportCsv.test.ts"
    },
    {
      "id": "high-pdf-html-injection",
      "status": "fixed",
      "severity": "high",
      "severity_change_reason": "code now HTML‑escapes all user‑controlled data before embedding it in the PDF template – verified by __tests__/exportPdf.test.ts"
    },
    {
      "id": "medium-deps-sprintf-js-2026-97058",
      "status": "open",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severity_change_reason": "no change – sprintf‑js remains vulnerable and no update has been applied"
    },
    {
      "id": "medium-backup-passphrase-policy",
      "status": "open",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severity_change_reason": "no change – backup UI still accepts any non‑empty passphrase without enforcing length or complexity"
    },
    {
      "id": "medium-web-key-storage",
      "status": "open",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severity_change_reason": "no change – the optional web fallback persists the encryption key in localStorage"
    },
    {
      "id": "medium-temp-backup-file-deletion",
      "status": "open",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severity_change_reason": "no change – temporary backup files are not deleted after sharing"
    },
    {
      "id": "medium-input-validation-numeric",
